<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF NBA DEFENSIVE PLAYER OF THE YEAR WINNERS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF NBA DEFENSIVE PLAYER OF THE YEAR WINNERS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>List of NBA Defensive Player</p>
<p>of the Year winners:</p>
<p>1982-83 Sidney Moncrief, Milwaukee</p>
<p>1983-84 Sidney Moncrief, Milwaukee</p>
<p>1984-85 Mark Eaton, Utah</p>
<p>1985-86 Alvin Robertson, San Antonio</p>
<p>1986-87 Michael Cooper, Los Angeles Lakers</p>
<p>1987-88 Michael Jordan, Chicago</p>
<p>1988-89 Mark Eaton, Utah</p>
<p>1989-90 Dennis Rodman, Detroit</p>
<p>1990-91 Dennis Rodman, Detroit</p>
<p>1991-92 David Robinson, San Antonio</p>
<p>1992-93 Hakeem Olajuwon, Houston</p>
<p>1993-94 Hakeem Olajuwon, Houston</p>
<p>1994-95 Dikembe Mutombo, Denver</p>
<p>1995-96 Gary Payton, Seattle</p>
<p>1996-97 Dikembe Mutombo, Atlanta</p>
